license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalizations supporting papers on Clebsch geometry, arcs complete
  outside a prescribed conic, projective Reed–Solomon deep holes, local-unitary
  rigidity of stabilizer AME states, and bounded repair ports. Version 0.1.0
  establishes the shared finite-geometry foundation; version 0.2.0 adds the
  explicitly audited paper-facing theorem closures and shared human-readable
  interfaces for separately distributed finite certificates.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formalized mathematics
  - finite geometry
  - Clebsch geometry
  - coding theory
  - Reed–Solomon codes
  - quantum information
  - algebraic combinatorics
